    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW LAUNCH: Harbour Court, Lecarrow Village, Athlone, Co. Roscommon\nSix luxury four-bedroom detached homes | Open viewing Saturday, 3rd October, 11am?3pm\nSheehy Meares Team Earley is delighted to announce the launch of Harbour Court, an exciting new development of six luxury four-bedroom detached homes in the picturesque village of Lecarrow, Co. Roscommon.\nDeveloped by renowned builder Brehon Construction Ltd, Harbour Court offers a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious, energy-efficient family home in an attractive village setting, within easy reach of Roscommon Town and Athlone.\nThe development comprises six architecturally designed detached homes, offering two distinctive house types with generous accommodation extending to approximately 2,450 sq. ft. and 2,508 sq. ft. The properties have been designed with modern family living in mind, combining spacious interiors, quality construction and a high standard of finish throughout.\nEach home benefits from an A energy rating, an air-to-water heat pump with zoned underfloor heating, triple-glazed windows and doors, heat-recovery ventilation, hollow-core concrete floors and an oak staircase. Additional finishes include oak shaker-style internal doors, skirting boards, Stira attic stairs and internal walls have been primed, allowing purchasers to put their own finishing touches on their new home.\nExternally, the properties benefit from completed front and rear lawns, tarmacadam driveways, kerbing, footpaths and block boundary walls with panel fencing, and an expansive green area to front.\nOne of Harbour Court's principal attractions is its location. Lecarrow is a charming village situated close to Lecarrow Harbour and the shores of Lough Ree, offering a peaceful countryside setting while remaining conveniently accessible to the thriving towns of Roscommon and Athlone. The infamous Coffeys Bar is a mere 2 minute walk from your door.\nWith only six detached homes available, Harbour Court presents an opportunity for purchasers seeking a substantial, newly constructed family home with modern energy efficiency in an established village setting.\nLegals: Brid Miller, Solicitor, Athlone Road, Roscommon Town. Telephone: (090) 662 7777\n\nNEW LAUNCH & OPEN VIEWING\nSaturday, 3rd October | 11am?3pm\nSheehy Meares Team Earley invites prospective purchasers to attend the official launch and open viewing at Harbour Court. This is an opportunity to view the development, appreciate the spacious accommodation and quality of construction, and experience the attractive village location first-hand.\nFor further information or to register your interest, contact Sheehy Meares Team Earley Real Estate.\nRoscommon Office: 090 662 6579\nAthlone Office: 090 641 7024\nEmail: info@sheehymeares.ie\n"
      },
